#: ../../source/tutorial-first-experiment.rst:4
msgid "Tutorial: your first controlled experiment"
msgstr "教程：你的第一个对照实验"

#: ../../source/tutorial-first-experiment.rst:6
msgid ""
":doc:`Quickstart <quickstart>` ran one training once. A real experiment "
"compares configurations under identical conditions and reads the results "
"back. In this tutorial you will compare three algorithms at two sampling "
"ratios, then dissect what \"communication cost\" actually means in fl-"
"sim."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Quickstart <quickstart>` "
"只跑了一次训练。真正的实验要在相同条件下比较不同配置，并把结果读回来。本教程将比较三个算法在两种采样比例下的表现，然后剖析 fl-sim "
"中\"通信开销\"究竟指什么。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-first-experiment.rst:11
msgid ""
"Everything runs on "
":class:`~fl_sim.data_processing.fed_synthetic.FedSynthetic` — no "
"downloads, seconds per run. The full script shown below lives at ``test-"
"files/tutorial_first_experiment.py`` and is exercised in CI."
msgstr ""
"全部运行基于 "
":class:`~fl_sim.data_processing.fed_synthetic.FedSynthetic`——无需下载，每次运行只需几秒。下文展示的完整脚本位于"
" ``test-files/tutorial_first_experiment.py``，并在 CI 中被执行。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-first-experiment.rst:15
msgid ""
"Prerequisites: :doc:`quickstart` (the three-object model: dataset, model,"
" server) and :doc:`concepts` (what a round does)."
msgstr "前置阅读： :doc:`quickstart` （三对象模型：数据集、模型、服务器）与  :doc:`concepts` （一轮训练做了什么）。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-first-experiment.rst:19
msgid "Set up the comparison"
msgstr "搭建对照"

#: ../../source/tutorial-first-experiment.rst:21
msgid ""
"Six runs: **FedAvg** (plain averaging), **FedProx** (proximal-regularized"
" local objectives) and **SCAFFOLD** (control variates) — the classic "
"gradient, proximal and variance-reduction axes — each at **sampling "
"ratios 0.5 and 1.0**."
msgstr ""
"六次运行： **FedAvg** （朴素平均）、 **FedProx** （近端正则的本地目标）与  **SCAFFOLD** "
"（控制变量）——梯度、近端、方差缩减三条经典轴线——各自在  **采样比例 0.5 与 1.0** 下运行。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-first-experiment.rst:26
msgid ""
"One deliberate choice: the dataset is constructed **once, before any "
"config or server**. Config constructors re-seed the global RNG as they "
"are built, so whatever was constructed last would otherwise shift the "
"sampling stream of everything after it. The order *dataset → config → "
"server* keeps every run reproducible:"
msgstr ""
"一个刻意的选择：数据集 **只构造一次，且先于任何配置或服务器** 。配置类的构造器在构建时会重置全局 "
"RNG，谁最后构造谁生效，其后的采样流都会被移动。按 *数据集 → 配置 → 服务器* 的顺序构造，每次运行都可复现："

#: ../../source/tutorial-first-experiment.rst:37
msgid ""
"``final_accuracy`` reads a run's JSON log — the same file format you saw "
"in :doc:`quickstart`. SCAFFOLD needs its global step size ``lr`` passed "
"explicitly (its config has no default for it); FedPD will need a "
"frequency parameter later. Both are per-algorithm server keywords, "
"collected in ``SERVER_KW``."
msgstr ""
"``final_accuracy`` 读取一次运行的 JSON 日志——与 :doc:`quickstart` 中相同的文件格式。SCAFFOLD"
" 需要显式传入全局步长 ``lr``（它的配置没有默认值）；FedPD 稍后也需要一个频率参数。两者都是算法各自的服务器关键字，统一收在 "
"``SERVER_KW`` 里。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-first-experiment.rst:44
msgid "Run and read the results"
msgstr "运行并读取结果"

#: ../../source/tutorial-first-experiment.rst:46
msgid ""
"The comparison itself is a loop, and the results land in a "
":class:`pandas.DataFrame`:"
msgstr "对照本身就是一个循环，结果落入 :class:`pandas.DataFrame` ："

#: ../../source/tutorial-first-experiment.rst:54
msgid ""
"Output on one machine (your numbers may differ slightly by package "
"version):"
msgstr "在一种机器上的输出（你的数字可能因包版本略有差异）："

#: ../../source/tutorial-first-experiment.rst:67
msgid "Two honest observations about this table:"
msgstr "对这张表的两点如实观察："

#: ../../source/tutorial-first-experiment.rst:69
msgid ""
"This synthetic task is *easy* — FedProx and SCAFFOLD reach the same "
"accuracy ceiling as FedAvg at full sampling. Their advantages show up on "
"harder, more heterogeneous tasks (see the :doc:`algorithm theory pages "
"<algorithms/overview>` for when each helps)."
msgstr ""
"这个合成任务 *太容易* ——全采样下 FedProx 与 SCAFFOLD 达到了和 FedAvg "
"相同的精度天花板。它们的优势要在更难、异质性更强的任务上才显现（何时用哪个，见 :doc:`算法理论页 "
"<algorithms/overview>` ）。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-first-experiment.rst:74
msgid ""
"The accuracy story saturates; the **communication** story does not. Every"
" run at ratio 0.5 used exactly 90 communications and every run at ratio "
"1.0 used exactly 180 — regardless of the algorithm. That number deserves "
"a closer look, because it is easy to misread."
msgstr ""
"精度的故事饱和了， **通信** 的故事没有：比例 0.5 的每次运行都恰好用了 90 次通信，比例 1.0 的都恰好 180 "
"次——与算法无关。这个数字值得细看，因为它很容易被误读。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-first-experiment.rst:80
msgid "What ``num_communications`` counts"
msgstr "``num_communications`` 数的是什么"

#: ../../source/tutorial-first-experiment.rst:82
msgid ""
"``num_communications`` counts **messages, not rounds**: each round adds "
"one downlink broadcast *per sampled client* plus one uplink reply *per "
"sampled client*. With 30 clients at ratio 0.5, every round is 15 "
"downlinks + 15 uplinks = 30 messages, so 3 rounds = 90; at ratio 1.0 that"
" doubles to 180."
msgstr ""
"``num_communications`` 统计的是 **消息数，不是轮数** ：每轮对 *每个被采样客户端* "
"加一次下行广播，再加一次上行回复。30 个客户端、比例 0.5 时，每轮是 15 下行 + 15 上行 = 30 条消息，3 轮 = 90；比例 "
"1.0 时翻倍为 180。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-first-experiment.rst:88
msgid ""
"The discriminating check: **3 rounds at full sampling and 6 rounds at "
"half sampling both land on 180.** The counter scales with ``2 × "
"sampled_clients × rounds``, not with rounds. Reading it as "
"\"communication rounds\" would make 90 look like \"90 rounds\" — off by a"
" factor of 30."
msgstr ""
"判别性的检验： **3 轮全采样与 6 轮半采样都恰好是 180。** 计数随 ``2 × 采样数 × 轮数`` "
"缩放，而不是随轮数。把它读成\"通信轮数\"，90 就会被当成\"90 轮\"——差了 30 倍。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-first-experiment.rst:94
msgid "The decomposition to keep in mind:"
msgstr "值得记住的分解式："

#: ../../source/tutorial-first-experiment.rst:96
msgid "\\text{FedAvg} = 2 \\times \\text{sampled} \\times \\text{rounds}"
msgstr "\\text{FedAvg} = 2 \\times \\text{sampled} \\times \\text{rounds}"

#: ../../source/tutorial-first-experiment.rst:100
msgid ""
"(Note also that the ``step`` recorded in the JSON log is a snapshot taken"
" at the *start* of each round: it trails the final counter by the last "
"round's full cost — read the final count from the server, as the scripts "
"here do.)"
msgstr ""
"（另注：JSON 日志里记录的 ``step`` 是 *每轮开始时* "
"的快照：它比最终计数少最后一轮的全部开销——最终值请从服务器读取，正如本页脚本的做法。）"

#: ../../source/tutorial-first-experiment.rst:106
msgid "Sampling is not communicating"
msgstr "被采样不等于在通信"

#: ../../source/tutorial-first-experiment.rst:108
msgid ""
"All three algorithms above communicate every round. fl-sim also ships "
"**communication-skipping** algorithms, and they break the ``2 × sampled ×"
" rounds`` identity in an instructive way. Run FedPD — which uploads only "
"every ``int(1/p)``-th round — for five rounds next to a five-round "
"FedAvg:"
msgstr ""
"上面三个算法每一轮都在通信。fl-sim 还内置 **可跳过通信** 的算法，它们会以很有启发性的方式打破 ``2 × 采样数 × 轮数`` "
"的恒等式。让 FedPD（每 ``int(1/p)`` 轮才上传一次）与五轮 FedAvg 并排各跑五轮："

#: ../../source/tutorial-first-experiment.rst:119
msgid "Output on one machine:"
msgstr "在一种机器上的输出："

#: ../../source/tutorial-first-experiment.rst:126
msgid ""
"The decomposition says it precisely: **the downlink is identical** (75 = "
"5 rounds × 15 clients — broadcasting to the sampled set is never "
"skipped); FedPD saves *uplinks only*. Five FedPD rounds cost the same 90 "
"messages as three FedAvg rounds — the same communication budget buys two "
"extra local iterations."
msgstr ""
"分解式把话说得非常准： **下行完全相同** （75 = 5 轮 × 15 客户端——对被采样集合的广播从不跳过）；FedPD 省下的 "
"*全是上行* 。五轮 FedPD 花费的 90 条消息与三轮 FedAvg 相同——同样的通信预算换来了多两轮的本地迭代。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-first-experiment.rst:132
msgid "Three practical details when you run this yourself:"
msgstr "自己动手跑时的三个实用细节："

#: ../../source/tutorial-first-experiment.rst:134
msgid ""
"``p`` must satisfy **0 < p < 1**. With p = 1 FedPD uploads every round "
"(degenerating to FedAvg); with p > 1 the upload frequency becomes zero "
"and the run crashes. The config exposes ``p`` but the derived upload "
"frequency ``int(1/p)`` always wins — passing a ``comm_freq`` yourself is "
"silently overwritten."
msgstr ""
"``p`` 必须满足 **0 < p < 1** 。p = 1 时 FedPD 每轮都上传（退化为 FedAvg）；p > 1 "
"时上传频率变为零，运行直接崩溃。配置暴露的是 ``p`` ，派生的上传频率 ``int(1/p)`` 始终说了算——自己传 "
"``comm_freq`` 会被静默覆写。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-first-experiment.rst:139
msgid ""
"**You will see RuntimeWarnings — they are expected, not errors.** The "
"server logs ``No message received from the clients...`` once per skipped "
"round (\"nobody uploaded this round, so the global model did not move\"),"
" and each skipping client logs ``No parameters received from server...`` "
"(\"I was not given a new global model this round, so I keep working from "
"my current parameters\"). At tutorial scale the client-side message "
"appears once per (skipped client × skipped round), so it dominates the "
"console. Both are how FedPD is designed to behave."
msgstr ""
" **你会看到 RuntimeWarning——那是预期行为，不是错误。** 服务器对每个跳过的轮次记录 ``No message "
"received from the clients...`` （\"这轮没人上传，全局模型没有动\"）；每个跳过的客户端记录 ``No "
"parameters received from server...`` "
"（\"这轮没收到新的全局模型，我继续用当前参数\"）。教程规模下，客户端侧的消息每个（跳过客户端 × 跳过轮次）出现一次，会刷满控制台。两者都是 "
"FedPD 的设计行为。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-first-experiment.rst:147
msgid ""
"The JSON ``step`` snapshot trails differently per algorithm: for the "
"five-round FedAvg it ends at 120 (the last round's 30 messages are "
"unlogged), for FedPD at 75 (its last round never uploads). The final "
"counts come from ``server._num_communications``."
msgstr ""
"JSON 的 ``step`` 快照落后多少因算法而异：五轮 FedAvg 终于 120（最后一轮的 30 条消息未入日志），FedPD 终于 "
"75（它的最后一轮从不上传）。最终计数请以 ``server._num_communications`` 为准。"

